TEXT 2400 2300 Left 1 Rp/Cp = 1 us RC (kills switching pickup, passes 1 kHz PWM).\nRd 10k pull-down: a disconnected wire = LED OFF (fail-safe).\nDc clamps overshoot.  74HCT14 gives TTL thresholds + ~0.9 V\nhysteresis, so the Arduino ground can bounce and the driver\nstill sees clean edges.  Two inverters restore polarity.
